  86+ 3CF1              ;
  87+ 3CF1              ; p126_overlay_allocate_page:
  88+ 3CF1              ;   OUT A=physical page 07h..0Fh, carry clear; A=0/carry set if exhausted.
  89+ 3CF1              ;   Clobbers BC, IX.
  90+ 3CF1              ;
  91+ 3CF1              ; p126_overlay_release_page:
  92+ 3CF1              ;   IN A=physical page. Carry clear on release; carry set with A=status on
  93+ 3CF1              ;   invalid, already-free, currently mapped, or actively executing page.
  94+ 3CF1              ;   Clobbers BC, DE, HL, IX.
